            datasheet: "4-bit synchronous counter\n\nCounts up on the rising edge of CLK while EN = 1 (0, 1, … 15, 0). Q0 is the least significant bit. CO = 1 while EN = 1 and the count is 15 (cascade it into the EN of the next counter). CLR = 1 clears the count at once.",
